@page "/log-sheets/help"
@page "/Logs/Doc/Doc_Logsheets.htm"
@rendermode InteractiveServer

<PageTitle>Logsheet Help - Fleet Information System</PageTitle>

<div class="page-header">
    <div class="page-header-content">
        <h1 class="page-title">
            <i class="bx bx-help-circle"></i>
            Logsheet Maintenance Information / Help
        </h1>
        <p class="page-description">Guidance for logsheet capture and reporting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="page-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/log-sheets">Back to Logsheet Menu</a>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page-content">
    <div class="form-card">
        <div class="form-card-header">
            <h2>Overview</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="form-card-body">
            <p>Use this module to capture monthly logsheets, correct captured entries, and generate operational reports.</p>
            <p>The workflow and report names mirror the logsheet menu structure.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-card">
        <div class="form-card-header">
            <h2>Core Actions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="form-card-body">
            <ul>
                <li>`Enter a Logsheet`: capture monthly odometer and usage data.</li>
                <li>`Delete a Logsheet`: remove incorrect logsheet entries.</li>
                <li>`Edit Logsheets`: update captured values where allowed.</li>
                <li>`Report: Logsheets captured`: run date/time and user-level capture activity reports.</li>
                <li>`Report: Total Km per Class Code`: summarize traveled distance by vehicle class over a selected period.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="form-card">
        <div class="form-card-header">
            <h2>Navigation</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="form-card-body">
            <div class="form-actions">
                <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/log-sheets/enter">Enter Logsheet</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/log-sheets/delete">Delete Logsheet</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/log-sheets/edit">Edit Logsheets</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/log-sheets/reports/captured">Logsheets Captured Report</a>
                <a class="btn btn-secondary btn-sm" href="/log-sheets/reports/total-km">Total Km per Class Code</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
